  - Ornithorhynchus anatinus
  - platypus
  - conservation genomics
  - genetic drift
  - founder effect
  - introduced population
  - island population
  - effective population size
  - single-nucleotide polymorphism
  - DArTseq
  - Kangaroo Island
  - genetic reinforcement
